    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/602fbd2ce487efcc1b6252a958a4b438.avif?t=1739918544\" /></div><br><br>You are the FORKLIFT FLOWERPOT: a modern marvel of engineering perfection.<br><br>Drive, Sail, and Fork your way around a strange archipelago and study plants across different climates and times. Change between three seasons at your whim to solve puzzles and navigate between islands. Meet wacky characters, participate in local sporting events, and delve deep into the mysteries of a strange land.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/f1c38ef216cbb98fa509709ba5ed1bf1.poster.avif?t=1739918544\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/f1c38ef216cbb98fa509709ba5ed1bf1.webm?t=1739918544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/f1c38ef216cbb98fa509709ba5ed1bf1.mp4?t=1739918544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Drive and sail around to explore a lush 2.5D claymation-inspired archipelago.<br></li><li>Change between three strange seasons to solve puzzles and navigate your way between islands.<br></li><li>Use THE WEB to connect clues and unearth the conspiracy at the heart of Spudbubby's Speedy Shipping Company.<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/c2b5db138d0189db9bb7fe7748b07510.poster.avif?t=1739918544\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/c2b5db138d0189db9bb7fe7748b07510.webm?t=1739918544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/c2b5db138d0189db9bb7fe7748b07510.mp4?t=1739918544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li>In Windy Season, gusts from the Accordion Isles race across the land, opening new paths for exploration.<br></li><li>During Wet Season, a heavy rainfall from Mt.Springly covers the land and provides crucial nourishment for plant life.<br></li><li>At Harvest Season's peak, you'll find a variety of bouncy mushrooms, fruiting plants, and ANGRY BOSSES WONDERING WHY YOU HAVEN'T REPORTED FOR YOUR HARVEST SEASON WORK SHIFT!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/9d19c5b7dfdad91c606238744793c2d1.poster.avif?t=1739918544\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/9d19c5b7dfdad91c606238744793c2d1.webm?t=1739918544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/9d19c5b7dfdad91c606238744793c2d1.mp4?t=1739918544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li>Play a deckbuilding card game with the giant tomato gods that oversee the land.<br></li><li>Draft a variety of powerful cards to grow your garden and secure victory.<br></li><li>Sneak in and steal fruits from your opponents garden, you know you want to!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/602fbd2ce487efcc1b6252a958a4b438.avif?t=1739918544\" /></div><br><br>You are the FORKLIFT FLOWERPOT: a modern marvel of engineering perfection.<br><br>Drive, Sail, and Fork your way around a strange archipelago and study plants across different climates and times. Change between three seasons at your whim to solve puzzles and navigate between islands. Meet wacky characters, participate in local sporting events, and delve deep into the mysteries of a strange land.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/f1c38ef216cbb98fa509709ba5ed1bf1.poster.avif?t=1739918544\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/f1c38ef216cbb98fa509709ba5ed1bf1.webm?t=1739918544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/f1c38ef216cbb98fa509709ba5ed1bf1.mp4?t=1739918544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Drive and sail around to explore a lush 2.5D claymation-inspired archipelago.<br></li><li>Change between three strange seasons to solve puzzles and navigate your way between islands.<br></li><li>Use THE WEB to connect clues and unearth the conspiracy at the heart of Spudbubby's Speedy Shipping Company.<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/c2b5db138d0189db9bb7fe7748b07510.poster.avif?t=1739918544\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/c2b5db138d0189db9bb7fe7748b07510.webm?t=1739918544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/c2b5db138d0189db9bb7fe7748b07510.mp4?t=1739918544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li>In Windy Season, gusts from the Accordion Isles race across the land, opening new paths for exploration.<br></li><li>During Wet Season, a heavy rainfall from Mt.Springly covers the land and provides crucial nourishment for plant life.<br></li><li>At Harvest Season's peak, you'll find a variety of bouncy mushrooms, fruiting plants, and ANGRY BOSSES WONDERING WHY YOU HAVEN'T REPORTED FOR YOUR HARVEST SEASON WORK SHIFT!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/9d19c5b7dfdad91c606238744793c2d1.poster.avif?t=1739918544\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/9d19c5b7dfdad91c606238744793c2d1.webm?t=1739918544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073330/extras/9d19c5b7dfdad91c606238744793c2d1.mp4?t=1739918544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li>Play a deckbuilding card game with the giant tomato gods that oversee the land.<br></li><li>Draft a variety of powerful cards to grow your garden and secure victory.<br></li><li>Sneak in and steal fruits from your opponents garden, you know you want to!</li></ul>",
